 "intro_zh": "江布拉克景区位于天山北麓，准噶尔盆地东南缘，总面积48平方公里，是典型温带干旱区山地垂直综合景观和特有的山地麦田版画的完美结合，是新疆天山世界自然遗产地延续景观，主要景点有天山麦海、疏勒古城（石城子遗址）、麻沟梁村、天山怪坡、花海子、江布拉克大峡谷、断桥、三道扁子、新户河。",
 "intro_en": "Changji Hui Autonomous Prefecture (Chinese: 昌吉回族自治州; Uyghur: سانجى خۇيزۇ ئاپتونوم ئوبلاستى) is an autonomous prefecture for Hui people in the mid-north of Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Region, Western China. The prefecture has an area of 77,129 km2 (29,780 sq mi) and its seat is Changji City. To the south lies the snow-capped Tianshan Mountains throughout the year, with extensive forests and pastures at the mountain foot; the northern region consists of vast grasslands in the Junggar Basin. The population of Changji Prefecture is ethnically diverse, with Han Chinese making up approximately 75%, Hui people around 10%, and Kazakh people about 9% of the total population.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
